            "Digoxin: draw level ≥6h post-dose; current heart failure target is 0.5-0.9ng/mL — lower than older historical ranges",
            "Lithium: draw level exactly 12h post-dose; clearance is sodium-dependent — diuretics, ACEi/ARBs, NSAIDs, and dehydration all raise toxicity risk",
            "Digoxin toxicity is potentiated by hypokalaemia, hypomagnesaemia, hypercalcaemia, and renal impairment"
